{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "b",
  "task": "t120",
  "chunk": "b/054",
  "family": "WAR20"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u17525",
   "en": "It's not the geth; it's the energy field they put up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17526",
   "en": "Next thing I knew, the geth ship latched on and the power went out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17527",
   "en": "A few geth won't stop me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17528",
   "en": "I'll fight my way through the geth soon enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17529",
   "en": "Not for me it isn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17530",
   "en": "When the geth attacked, I stayed behind to send a message to Colonial Affairs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17531",
   "en": "It's just a plant. I don't know why the geth would care.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17532",
   "en": "ExoGeni was studying it, but I don't think they found anything special.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17533",
   "en": "I'm just a research assistant for ExoGeni.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17534",
   "en": "I came here with my mother. I don't even know if she made it out alive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17535",
   "en": "I really don't know that much about it. I think it's some kind of plant being.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17536",
   "en": "I know it's very old. Thousands of years, even.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17537",
   "en": "There you are!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17538",
   "en": "Tell me what you know about the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17540",
   "en": "Just get on with it. I want to at least see the Thorian dead before they ship us out of here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17541",
   "en": "This has gone on too long. Just kill the Thorian and try to help the infected.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17542",
   "en": "I suppose it's time for us to go. Thank you for what you did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17543",
   "en": "It's better than dead, I suppose. I just wish.... Never mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17544",
   "en": "Soon we'll have everything we need.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17545",
   "en": "We're going to be very busy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17546",
   "en": "You won't recognize anything in a year. A clean slate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17547",
   "en": "There's nothing left here. I can't wait to get offworld.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17548",
   "en": "It's hard to imagine we even had a chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17549",
   "en": "I hope I never hear about this place ever again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17550",
   "en": "It'll be rough-going, but we have a chance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17551",
   "en": "I'm looking forward to making this place work.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17552",
   "en": "It'll take a while, but we can make it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17553",
   "en": "Here, take my ID. This should get you past any locked doors.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17554",
   "en": "You can't do this, Jeong!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17555",
   "en": "Everyone shut up! Let me think!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17556",
   "en": "Damn it! Come out where I can see you! All of you!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17557",
   "en": "It's my own fault. Everyone else was running and I stayed to back up data.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17558",
   "en": "They don't want anyone else getting access to the--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17559",
   "en": "I don't know for certain, but I'm guessing they're here for the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17560",
   "en": "Thorian? What is that, exactly?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17561",
   "en": "What's a Thorian?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17562",
   "en": "Thorian? I have never heard of such a thing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17563",
   "en": "Thorian? What's that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17564",
   "en": "It's an indigenous life-form. ExoGeni was studying it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17565",
   "en": "No, not exactly. But I think the geth ship is powering it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17566",
   "en": "I've noticed the geth laying power cables everywhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17567",
   "en": "You could follow those cables, but there's geth all over the place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17568",
   "en": "Yeah, you don't have to tell me twice. I'll just find a small hole to hide in until the field is down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17569",
   "en": "She's alive? Thank God. I thought I was the only one left.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17570",
   "en": "Please, Commander. Just get that field down so I can see my mother again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17571",
   "en": "We should get out of here. I don't think this place is safe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17572",
   "en": "I tried to tell them where to find the Thorian, but the power cut before I could send the message.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17573",
   "en": "I-- I never meant for this to happen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17574",
   "en": "The Thorian is underneath Zhu's Hope, but the entrance is blocked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17575",
   "en": "The colonists covered it with the freighter just before the geth attacked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17576",
   "en": "Well, it does have unique mind-control capabilities.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17577",
   "en": "That's what ExoGeni was interested in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17578",
   "en": "I'm coming with you. I might be able to help. Undo the mess I helped create.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17579",
   "en": "You're safe now. But why were you here in the first place?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17580",
   "en": "We'll get you out as soon as we find out what the geth are after.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17581",
   "en": "I'm here for the geth. If you know something, tell me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17582",
   "en": "I'm here for the geth. It's very important that I find out what they're after.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17583",
   "en": "Any suggestions?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17584",
   "en": "Do you know how we can shut it down?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17585",
   "en": "All right. I'll look into it. Stay put until the field is down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17586",
   "en": "She's with some others from the colony. She's safe for now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17587",
   "en": "I need some answers. You knew more about the Thorian than you let on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17588",
   "en": "You said you didn't know about the Thorian. I don't like being lied to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17589",
   "en": "You did what you could. I'll help them if you can tell me where to find the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17590",
   "en": "Where's the Thorian?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17591",
   "en": "Just tell me where I can find the Thorian. No more lies.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17592",
   "en": "But why are the geth after the Thorian? What could Saren want with it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17593",
   "en": "What bothers me is why the geth were after the Thorian in the first place.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17594",
   "en": "You can tell me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17595",
   "en": "Don't hold back!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17596",
   "en": "In a minute.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17597",
   "en": "Not a concern.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17598",
   "en": "First things first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17599",
   "en": "Normandy to shore party. Come in.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17600",
   "en": "Looks like they're headed your way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17601",
   "en": "What is it, Joker?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17602",
   "en": "Thanks for the heads-up, Joker. You heard the man; let's move out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17603",
   "en": "You heard the man; let's move out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17604",
   "en": "What now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17605",
   "en": "Nice job.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17606",
   "en": "I might be able to, but not with those geth crawling around everywhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17607",
   "en": "Look, we need to get out of here, past that field.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17608",
   "en": "I need more information. I need to know why the geth are after this Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17609",
   "en": "What else can you tell me? Do you know where I can find this Thorian?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17610",
   "en": "Tell me more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_10b_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17611",
   "en": "We're getting a lot of geth comm chatter.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03a_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR40_06_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR50_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17612",
   "en": "If we could take the fight to these geth, we would. But we're not soldiers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17613",
   "en": "At least the geth can't regroup at the command post any more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17614",
   "en": "No one understands what we are trying to build here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17615",
   "en": "This colony will outlast any threat thrown at it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17616",
   "en": "This planet's not so bad when it isn't under the grip of some hidden threat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17617",
   "en": "It feels so good to be free again. We have another chance at making a home here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17618",
   "en": "We'll try our best to make this colony work. I know we can do it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17619",
   "en": "I guess Feros was bound to fail. Too many factors against us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17620",
   "en": "I look forward to getting back to Earth. This place was never home.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17621",
   "en": "I want a home that isn't getting tossed around on the frontline of a war.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17622",
   "en": "They tell me you survived Akuze. Glad you're on our side.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17623",
   "en": "You were at the Skyllian Blitz, right? Never thought someone like you would help us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17624",
   "en": "You were at Torfan, right? Glad you're on our side.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17625",
   "en": "You helped some of us survive. Guess that's better than nothing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17626",
   "en": "What's it say about Feros when a hero like you can't even save it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17627",
   "en": "I guess we're lucky anyone survived. No offense, but I don't want Feros remembered like Torfan.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17628",
   "en": "Get ready.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17629",
   "en": "How do you fight an army of synthetics? Are they even alive?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17630",
   "en": "This is it. The last stand.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17631",
   "en": "Stop the intruders at all costs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17632",
   "en": "They'll try to rebuild the command post soon enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17633",
   "en": "At least we've got a chance to regroup.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17634",
   "en": "I don't think I've slept since they began their attack.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17635",
   "en": "They're still out there. I hate those geth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17636",
   "en": "I have my own thoughts again. Thank you, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17637",
   "en": "Now that the alien influence is purged, we can get back to building a profitable colony.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17638",
   "en": "We will build up our defenses and make sure Feros stays in human hands.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17639",
   "en": "Feros will survive. Thanks to you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17640",
   "en": "It will take some effort to pull up stakes, but I'll be glad to be out of this hole.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17641",
   "en": "I'm sorry I ever signed on to colonize this forsaken planet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17642",
   "en": "Living on the frontier was supposed to be exciting. Losing my mind to a plant was not part of the deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17643",
   "en": "I'm sick of being a pawn. Colonial Affairs can shove this posting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17644",
   "en": "Stop the geth!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17645",
   "en": "They'll be here any minute!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17646",
   "en": "The geth fight like fanatics. That can't just be programming, can it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17647",
   "en": "We won't fall to to the geth without a fight.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17648",
   "en": "Thanks for your help. At least we have time to regroup.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17649",
   "en": "They're still out there. But at least they've been slowed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17650",
   "en": "We won't be safe until every last geth is destroyed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17651",
   "en": "The geth have destroyed our home. It'll take years to rebuild.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17652",
   "en": "I am free... Thank you. I am so glad to get that plant out of my head.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17653",
   "en": "I think I'll stay. Help reclaim the colony. It's a chance for a new beginning.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17654",
   "en": "I want to try to make this colony work. I hope we'll have the chance now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17655",
   "en": "Feros will be back in shape in no time, Commander. We'll make sure of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17656",
   "en": "I can't wait to get out of here, Shepard. This place may as well be cursed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17657",
   "en": "Nothing here is worth the pain I've been through.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17658",
   "en": "I am so tired of being a pawn. I'm getting out while I can.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17659",
   "en": "This is it for me. I'm going back to Earth on the next ship.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17660",
   "en": "Glad to see some soldiers. Our numbers are getting thin.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17661",
   "en": "We get weaker with every attack.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17662",
   "en": "The geth just keep coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17663",
   "en": "I've lost more friends in this battle than I can count.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17664",
   "en": "They're coming. They just keep on coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17665",
   "en": "The geth never get hungry. They never tire.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17666",
   "en": "I hope Fai Dan can do something to stop the geth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17667",
   "en": "I can't go on much longer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17668",
   "en": "We couldn't bring much in the way of supplies with us. We need sustainable food.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17669",
   "en": "What good is surviving the attacks if we starve?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17670",
   "en": "Davin does what he can, but our food will run out sooner or later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17671",
   "en": "Hunger will weaken us in the long run.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17672",
   "en": "We have enough food for everyone to operate at their optimum.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17673",
   "en": "Now we must put our efforts towards stopping the geth.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17674",
   "en": "At least we won't starve before the geth wipe us out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u17675",
   "en": "This colony will survive. We will soon have all that we need.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_WAR20_03b_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_WAR20_03d_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
